OL,3,AIsraeli opposition accuses Netanyahu of
OL,4,Atrying to 'delegitimise' election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main Israeli opposition leader Gadi
OL,7,FEisenkot and Arab-led party leaders
OL,8,Fhave denounced Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,9,FNetanyahu for alleging foreign
OL,10,Finterference following the election
OL,11,Fwhich saw his coalition lose its
OL,12,Fmajority.
OL,14,FNetanyahu's Likud accused Israel's
OL,15,FArab-led parties of "stealing" the
OL,16,Felection. Home security agency Shin Bet
OL,17,Fis investigating whether they received
OL,18,Fillegal funding from Qatar and Turkey.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
