OL,3,AIsraeli opposition accuses Netanyahu of
OL,4,Atrying to 'delegitimise' election
OL,5,
OL,6,FQatar's foreign ministry denied the
OL,7,F"ridiculous and dangerous" allegations
OL,8,Fand accused Israeli politicians of
OL,9,Fconducting a disinformation campaign
OL,10,Fagainst Doha.
OL,12,FFinal results confirmed that neither
OL,13,FNetanyahu's bloc nor the Jewish
OL,14,Fopposition had won a majority in
OL,15,Fparliament.
